+## AGC 26.2 alpha19 - lossless logic algorithm optimiser
+
+Alpha19 focuses on real algorithm improvements rather than only resource efficiency. It keeps the same hard semantic rules while reducing the amount of repeated work needed to produce the same vanilla/Paper-visible result.
+
+New components:
+
+- `AGCScale19LogicKernel`: central budget for lossless algorithm work only. It never budgets Bukkit-visible state mutation.
+- `AGCNetworkMulticastShapeGraph`: builds immutable packet-shape multicast plans without packet drops, mutable packet sharing or per-connection reordering.
+- `AGCChunkDemandForecastTable`: movement-aware chunk demand forecasts. Forecasts are hints only and never skip FIFO heads or change Paper completion order.
+- `AGCEntityInterestSetReducer`: read-only set reduction for dense entity tracker candidates without skipping entity ticks, AI, damage or interaction.
+- `AGCWorldPhaseBatchCompiler`: compiles read-only world phase preparation batches while keeping redstone, block entities, entity ticks, plugin events and ordered commits as barriers.
+- `AGCPluginSemanticJit`: conservative semantic classification cache. Bukkit-visible operations stay ordered; unsafe/off-thread mutation remains forbidden.
+- `AGCAdaptiveLocalityRing`: tick-local helper scratch ring that never owns live world state.
+
+Operator report: `/agc scale19`. Public API: `AGC.performance().scale19Plan(players, targetTps)` and `AGCScale19Plan`.
+
+Hard rules remain unchanged: no packet drops, no mutable packet sharing, no connection reorder, no chunk FIFO skip, no entity tick/AI/damage/interaction skip, no Bukkit off-thread mutation, no plugin event reorder and no redstone/factory phase reorder.
